window.__code__["middleware-rag-py-456"] = {"code_id": "middleware-rag-py-456", "kind": "src", "title": "_rag.py:456", "source_path": "agentscope/src/agentscope/middleware/_rag.py", "highlight_line": 456, "code_html": "<div class=\"code-body\">\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"c-no\">1</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"c-no\">2</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;RAG middleware that brings knowledge-base search into the agent loop.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"c-no\">3</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"c-no\">4</span><span class=\"c-src\">The :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`RAGMiddleware` wraps one <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> more</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"5\"><span class=\"c-no\">5</span><span class=\"c-src\">:<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`~agentscope.rag.KnowledgeBase` runtime handles — each carrying</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"6\"><span class=\"c-no\">6</span><span class=\"c-src\">its own embedding model, vector store, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> (optional) metadata filter —</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"7\"><span class=\"c-no\">7</span><span class=\"c-src\">so a single agent can search across knowledge bases that were created</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"8\"><span class=\"c-no\">8</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> *different* embedding models.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"9\"><span class=\"c-no\">9</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"10\"><span class=\"c-no\">10</span><span class=\"c-src\">Two modes are supported, selected via :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`SearchConfig.mode`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"11\"><span class=\"c-no\">11</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"12\"><span class=\"c-no\">12</span><span class=\"c-src\">- ``<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;agentic&quot;</span>`` — exposes a single ``search_knowledge`` tool via</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"13\"><span class=\"c-no\">13</span><span class=\"c-src\">  :meth:`RAGMiddleware.list_tools`.  The agent decides when (<span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> which</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"c-no\">14</span><span class=\"c-src\">  knowledge bases) to query.  Nothing <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> injected automatically.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"15\"><span class=\"c-no\">15</span><span class=\"c-src\">- ``<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;static&quot;</span>`` — on the first reasoning step of each reply</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"16\"><span class=\"c-no\">16</span><span class=\"c-src\">  (``agent.state.cur_iter == 0``) the middleware searches <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"17\"><span class=\"c-no\">17</span><span class=\"c-src\">  fresh user turn <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> the query <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> injects the merged results into</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"18\"><span class=\"c-no\">18</span><span class=\"c-src\">  ``agent.state.context`` <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> a :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`~agentscope.message.HintBlock`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"19\"><span class=\"c-no\">19</span><span class=\"c-src\">  Optionally surfaces a</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"20\"><span class=\"c-no\">20</span><span class=\"c-src\">  :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`~agentscope.event.HintBlockEvent` so the front-end can</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"21\"><span class=\"c-no\">21</span><span class=\"c-src\">  display the matched snippets.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"c-no\">22</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"23\"><span class=\"c-no\">23</span><span class=\"c-src\">User-tunable parameters are declared on :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`SearchConfig`; the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"24\"><span class=\"c-no\">24</span><span class=\"c-src\">JSON Schema served to the front-end <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> derived <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> it via</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"25\"><span class=\"c-no\">25</span><span class=\"c-src\">``model_json_schema()``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"26\"><span class=\"c-no\">26</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"27\"><span class=\"c-no\">27</span><span class=\"c-src\">Document indexing (parsing, chunking, embedding, insertion) <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> *<span class=\"c-kw\">not</span>*</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"28\"><span class=\"c-no\">28</span><span class=\"c-src\">this middleware&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s job — it belongs to the caller (or, in the hosted</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"29\"><span class=\"c-no\">29</span><span class=\"c-src\">service, to the knowledge-base manager) that constructs the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"30\"><span class=\"c-no\">30</span><span class=\"c-src\">:<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`KnowledgeBase` instances passed <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span>.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"31\"><span class=\"c-no\">31</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"32\"><span class=\"c-no\">32</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> asyncio</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"33\"><span class=\"c-no\">33</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> json</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"34\"><span class=\"c-no\">34</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> copy <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> deepcopy</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"35\"><span class=\"c-no\">35</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> typing <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> (</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"c-no\">36</span><span class=\"c-src\">    TYPE_CHECKING,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"37\"><span class=\"c-no\">37</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Any,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"38\"><span class=\"c-no\">38</span><span class=\"c-src\">    AsyncGenerator,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"39\"><span class=\"c-no\">39</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Callable,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"40\"><span class=\"c-no\">40</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Literal,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"41\"><span class=\"c-no\">41</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Sequence,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"42\"><span class=\"c-no\">42</span><span class=\"c-src\">)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"43\"><span class=\"c-no\">43</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"44\"><span class=\"c-no\">44</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> pydantic <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> BaseModel, ConfigDict, Field, field_validator</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"45\"><span class=\"c-no\">45</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> pydantic.json_schema <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> SkipJsonSchema</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"46\"><span class=\"c-no\">46</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"47\"><span class=\"c-no\">47</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ._base <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> MiddlewareBase</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"48\"><span class=\"c-no\">48</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> .._logging <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> logger</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"49\"><span class=\"c-no\">49</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ..event <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> HintBlockEvent</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"50\"><span class=\"c-no\">50</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ..message <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> (</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"51\"><span class=\"c-no\">51</span><span class=\"c-src\">    DataBlock,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"52\"><span class=\"c-no\">52</span><span class=\"c-src\">    HintBlock,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"53\"><span class=\"c-no\">53</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Msg,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"54\"><span class=\"c-no\">54</span><span class=\"c-src\">    TextBlock,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"55\"><span class=\"c-no\">55</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ToolResultState,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"56\"><span class=\"c-no\">56</span><span class=\"c-src\">)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"57\"><span class=\"c-no\">57</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ..permission <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> PermissionBehavior, PermissionDecision</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"58\"><span class=\"c-no\">58</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ..tool <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> ParamsBase, ToolBase, ToolChunk</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"59\"><span class=\"c-no\">59</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"60\"><span class=\"c-no\">60</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> TYPE_CHECKING:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"61\"><span class=\"c-no\">61</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ..agent <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Agent</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"62\"><span class=\"c-no\">62</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ..rag <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> KnowledgeBase, VectorSearchResult</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"63\"><span class=\"c-no\">63</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"64\"><span class=\"c-no\">64</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"65\"><span class=\"c-no\">65</span><span class=\"c-src\">_DEFAULT_HINT_TEMPLATE = (</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"66\"><span class=\"c-no\">66</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&lt;system-reminder&gt;The following content is retrieved from the &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"67\"><span class=\"c-no\">67</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;knowledge base(s) and may be helpful for the current &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"68\"><span class=\"c-no\">68</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;request:\\n&lt;content&gt;{context}&lt;/content&gt;&lt;/system-reminder&gt;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"69\"><span class=\"c-no\">69</span><span class=\"c-src\">)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"70\"><span class=\"c-no\">70</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># Wrapper around the formatted search results.  Must contain a single</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"71\"><span class=\"c-no\">71</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># ``{context}`` placeholder — :func:`_wrap_hint` splits on it.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"72\"><span class=\"c-no\">72</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"73\"><span class=\"c-no\">73</span><span class=\"c-src\">_HINT_SOURCE = json.dumps({<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;label&quot;</span>: <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;KnowledgeBase&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;sublabel&quot;</span>: <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>})</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"74\"><span class=\"c-no\">74</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># The ``source`` value stamped on injected hint blocks.  Encoded as a</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"75\"><span class=\"c-no\">75</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># JSON string so the front-end can parse a structured label out of it</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"76\"><span class=\"c-no\">76</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># while the field stays a plain ``str`` everywhere else.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"77\"><span class=\"c-no\">77</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"78\"><span class=\"c-no\">78</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"79\"><span class=\"c-no\">79</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> _SearchParams(ParamsBase):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"80\"><span class=\"c-no\">80</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;The parameters accepted by ``_SearchKnowledgeTool``.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"81\"><span class=\"c-no\">81</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"82\"><span class=\"c-no\">82</span><span class=\"c-src\">    query: str = Field(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"83\"><span class=\"c-no\">83</span><span class=\"c-src\">        description=(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"84\"><span class=\"c-no\">84</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;The query string to search the knowledge base(s) with. &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"85\"><span class=\"c-no\">85</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Must be concise, explicit, and self-contained: AVOID &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"86\"><span class=\"c-no\">86</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;ambiguous references like `he`/`she`/`it`, &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"87\"><span class=\"c-no\">87</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;`today`/`yesterday`/`tomorrow`, `here`/`there`, etc. — &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"88\"><span class=\"c-no\">88</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;the search is purely semantic and has no conversational &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"89\"><span class=\"c-no\">89</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;context. Phrase the query as a complete statement of &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"90\"><span class=\"c-no\">90</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;what you want to find.&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"91\"><span class=\"c-no\">91</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"92\"><span class=\"c-no\">92</span><span class=\"c-src\">    )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"93\"><span class=\"c-no\">93</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"94\"><span class=\"c-no\">94</span><span class=\"c-src\">    knowledge_bases: list[str] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = Field(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"95\"><span class=\"c-no\">95</span><span class=\"c-src\">        default=<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"96\"><span class=\"c-no\">96</span><span class=\"c-src\">        description=(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"97\"><span class=\"c-no\">97</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Optional subset of knowledge bases to query, by name. &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"98\"><span class=\"c-no\">98</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;When omitted (or `null`) every equipped knowledge base &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"99\"><span class=\"c-no\">99</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;is searched. Names must exactly match those listed in &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"100\"><span class=\"c-no\">100</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;the tool description.&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"101\"><span class=\"c-no\">101</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"102\"><span class=\"c-no\">102</span><span class=\"c-src\">    )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"103\"><span class=\"c-no\">103</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"104\"><span class=\"c-no\">104</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"105\"><span class=\"c-no\">105</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> _SearchKnowledgeTool(ToolBase):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"106\"><span class=\"c-no\">106</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;The agentic-mode search tool exposed by :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`RAGMiddleware`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"107\"><span class=\"c-no\">107</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"108\"><span class=\"c-no\">108</span><span class=\"c-src\">    A single tool fans out across every bound knowledge base; the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"109\"><span class=\"c-no\">109</span><span class=\"c-src\">    agent may also <span class=\"c-kw\">pass</span> ``knowledge_bases`` to restrict the search to</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"110\"><span class=\"c-no\">110</span><span class=\"c-src\">    a subset by name.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"111\"><span class=\"c-no\">111</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"112\"><span class=\"c-no\">112</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"113\"><span class=\"c-no\">113</span><span class=\"c-src\">    name: str = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;search_knowledge&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"114\"><span class=\"c-no\">114</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;The tool name presented to the agent.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"115\"><span class=\"c-no\">115</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"116\"><span class=\"c-no\">116</span><span class=\"c-src\">    is_read_only: bool = <span class=\"c-kw\">True</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"117\"><span class=\"c-no\">117</span><span class=\"c-src\">    is_concurrency_safe: bool = <span class=\"c-kw\">True</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"118\"><span class=\"c-no\">118</span><span class=\"c-src\">    is_external_tool: bool = <span class=\"c-kw\">False</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"119\"><span class=\"c-no\">119</span><span class=\"c-src\">    is_state_injected: bool = <span class=\"c-kw\">False</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"120\"><span class=\"c-no\">120</span><span class=\"c-src\">    is_mcp: bool = <span class=\"c-kw\">False</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"121\"><span class=\"c-no\">121</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"122\"><span class=\"c-no\">122</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __init__(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"123\"><span class=\"c-no\">123</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"124\"><span class=\"c-no\">124</span><span class=\"c-src\">        knowledge_bases: list[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;KnowledgeBase&quot;</span>],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"125\"><span class=\"c-no\">125</span><span class=\"c-src\">        top_k: int,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"126\"><span class=\"c-no\">126</span><span class=\"c-src\">        score_threshold: float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"127\"><span class=\"c-no\">127</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"128\"><span class=\"c-no\">128</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Initialize the search tool.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"129\"><span class=\"c-no\">129</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"130\"><span class=\"c-no\">130</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"131\"><span class=\"c-no\">131</span><span class=\"c-src\">            knowledge_bases (`list[KnowledgeBase]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"132\"><span class=\"c-no\">132</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The knowledge bases the agent may query.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"133\"><span class=\"c-no\">133</span><span class=\"c-src\">            top_k (`int`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"134\"><span class=\"c-no\">134</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Maximum number of chunks returned per call, after</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"135\"><span class=\"c-no\">135</span><span class=\"c-src\">                merging across knowledge bases.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"136\"><span class=\"c-no\">136</span><span class=\"c-src\">            score_threshold (`float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"137\"><span class=\"c-no\">137</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Minimum similarity score; forwarded unchanged to each</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"138\"><span class=\"c-no\">138</span><span class=\"c-src\">                :meth:`KnowledgeBase.search` call.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"139\"><span class=\"c-no\">139</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"140\"><span class=\"c-no\">140</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># ``ToolBase`` expects a list of *tool* middlewares; this tool</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"141\"><span class=\"c-no\">141</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># has none of its own (the owning ``RAGMiddleware`` is an</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"142\"><span class=\"c-no\">142</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># *agent* middleware, not a tool one).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"143\"><span class=\"c-no\">143</span><span class=\"c-src\">        super().__init__()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"144\"><span class=\"c-no\">144</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases = knowledge_bases</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"145\"><span class=\"c-no\">145</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._top_k = top_k</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"146\"><span class=\"c-no\">146</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._score_threshold = score_threshold</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"147\"><span class=\"c-no\">147</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.description = <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._build_description()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"148\"><span class=\"c-no\">148</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.input_schema = <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._build_input_schema()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"149\"><span class=\"c-no\">149</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"150\"><span class=\"c-no\">150</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _build_description(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"151\"><span class=\"c-no\">151</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Build the tool description <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the currently equipped</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"152\"><span class=\"c-no\">152</span><span class=\"c-src\">        knowledge bases so the agent has enough context to decide which</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"153\"><span class=\"c-no\">153</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ones to query.<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"154\"><span class=\"c-no\">154</span><span class=\"c-src\">        lines = [</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"155\"><span class=\"c-no\">155</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Search the agent&#x27;s equipped knowledge bases by semantic &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"156\"><span class=\"c-no\">156</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;similarity and return the most relevant chunks.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"157\"><span class=\"c-no\">157</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"158\"><span class=\"c-no\">158</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;## When to Use&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"159\"><span class=\"c-no\">159</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;- The user&#x27;s question may be answered by content stored &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"160\"><span class=\"c-no\">160</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;in one of the listed knowledge bases (see *Equipped &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"161\"><span class=\"c-no\">161</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Knowledge Bases* below).&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"162\"><span class=\"c-no\">162</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;- You need supporting facts, definitions, or documents &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"163\"><span class=\"c-no\">163</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;that are unlikely to be in your parametric knowledge.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"164\"><span class=\"c-no\">164</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"165\"><span class=\"c-no\">165</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;## Guidance&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"166\"><span class=\"c-no\">166</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;- Knowledge base names and descriptions are &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"167\"><span class=\"c-no\">167</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;user-supplied and may be terse, vague, or unrelated to &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"168\"><span class=\"c-no\">168</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;the actual contents. When in doubt, try the search — a &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"169\"><span class=\"c-no\">169</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;single call is cheap and an empty result is informative.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"170\"><span class=\"c-no\">170</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;- Phrase `query` as a self-contained statement of what &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"171\"><span class=\"c-no\">171</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;you want to find. Avoid pronouns or relative time &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"172\"><span class=\"c-no\">172</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;references — the search is purely semantic and has no &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"173\"><span class=\"c-no\">173</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;conversational context.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"174\"><span class=\"c-no\">174</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;- Set `knowledge_bases` only when the question clearly &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"175\"><span class=\"c-no\">175</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;matches one or two specific bases; otherwise leave it &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"176\"><span class=\"c-no\">176</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;unset to search them all.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"177\"><span class=\"c-no\">177</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"178\"><span class=\"c-no\">178</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;## Equipped Knowledge Bases&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"179\"><span class=\"c-no\">179</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"180\"><span class=\"c-no\">180</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"181\"><span class=\"c-no\">181</span><span class=\"c-src\">            lines.append(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"182\"><span class=\"c-no\">182</span><span class=\"c-src\">                f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;The agent is currently equipped with &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"183\"><span class=\"c-no\">183</span><span class=\"c-src\">                f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;{len(self._knowledge_bases)} knowledge base(s):&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"184\"><span class=\"c-no\">184</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"185\"><span class=\"c-no\">185</span><span class=\"c-src\">            lines.extend(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"186\"><span class=\"c-no\">186</span><span class=\"c-src\">                f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;- **{kb.name}**: {kb.description}&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"187\"><span class=\"c-no\">187</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> kb <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"188\"><span class=\"c-no\">188</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"189\"><span class=\"c-no\">189</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"190\"><span class=\"c-no\">190</span><span class=\"c-src\">            lines.append(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"191\"><span class=\"c-no\">191</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;No knowledge bases are currently equipped. **Do &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"192\"><span class=\"c-no\">192</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;not call this tool** — it will return nothing.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"193\"><span class=\"c-no\">193</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"194\"><span class=\"c-no\">194</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span>.join(lines)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"195\"><span class=\"c-no\">195</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"196\"><span class=\"c-no\">196</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _build_input_schema(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; dict:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"197\"><span class=\"c-no\">197</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Build the JSON Schema, <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> ``knowledge_bases.items.enum``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"198\"><span class=\"c-no\">198</span><span class=\"c-src\">        narrowed to the currently equipped knowledge-base names so</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"199\"><span class=\"c-no\">199</span><span class=\"c-src\">        the LLM cannot invent unknown names.<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"200\"><span class=\"c-no\">200</span><span class=\"c-src\">        schema: dict[str, Any] = _SearchParams.model_json_schema()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"201\"><span class=\"c-no\">201</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"202\"><span class=\"c-no\">202</span><span class=\"c-src\">            names = [kb.name <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> kb <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"203\"><span class=\"c-no\">203</span><span class=\"c-src\">            kb_schema = schema[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;properties&quot;</span>][<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;knowledge_bases&quot;</span>]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"204\"><span class=\"c-no\">204</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># Pydantic emits ``Optional[list[str]]`` as</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"205\"><span class=\"c-no\">205</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># ``anyOf: [{type: array, items: ...}, {type: null}]``; we</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"206\"><span class=\"c-no\">206</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># narrow the array branch&#x27;s items.  Fall back to a direct</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"207\"><span class=\"c-no\">207</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># ``items`` field for the non-optional shape.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"208\"><span class=\"c-no\">208</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;items&quot;</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> kb_schema:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"209\"><span class=\"c-no\">209</span><span class=\"c-src\">                kb_schema[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;items&quot;</span>][<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;enum&quot;</span>] = names</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"210\"><span class=\"c-no\">210</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"211\"><span class=\"c-no\">211</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> variant <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> kb_schema.get(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;anyOf&quot;</span>, []):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"212\"><span class=\"c-no\">212</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> variant.get(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;type&quot;</span>) == <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;array&quot;</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;items&quot;</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> variant:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"213\"><span class=\"c-no\">213</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        variant[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;items&quot;</span>][<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;enum&quot;</span>] = names</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"214\"><span class=\"c-no\">214</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        <span class=\"c-kw\">break</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"215\"><span class=\"c-no\">215</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> schema</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"216\"><span class=\"c-no\">216</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"217\"><span class=\"c-no\">217</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> check_permissions(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"218\"><span class=\"c-no\">218</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"219\"><span class=\"c-no\">219</span><span class=\"c-src\">        tool_input: dict[str, Any],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"220\"><span class=\"c-no\">220</span><span class=\"c-src\">        context: Any,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"221\"><span class=\"c-no\">221</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; Any:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"222\"><span class=\"c-no\">222</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Allow the engine to handle this read-only search.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"223\"><span class=\"c-no\">223</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"224\"><span class=\"c-no\">224</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"225\"><span class=\"c-no\">225</span><span class=\"c-src\">            tool_input (`dict[str, Any]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"226\"><span class=\"c-no\">226</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The tool input data.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"227\"><span class=\"c-no\">227</span><span class=\"c-src\">            context (`PermissionContext`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"228\"><span class=\"c-no\">228</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The permission context.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"229\"><span class=\"c-no\">229</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"230\"><span class=\"c-no\">230</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"231\"><span class=\"c-no\">231</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `PermissionDecision`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"232\"><span class=\"c-no\">232</span><span class=\"c-src\">                An allow decision — knowledge-base search <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> read-only.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"233\"><span class=\"c-no\">233</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"234\"><span class=\"c-no\">234</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">del</span> tool_input, context</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"235\"><span class=\"c-no\">235</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> PermissionDecision(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"236\"><span class=\"c-no\">236</span><span class=\"c-src\">            behavior=PermissionBehavior.ALLOW,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"237\"><span class=\"c-no\">237</span><span class=\"c-src\">            message=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Knowledge-base search is read-only.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"238\"><span class=\"c-no\">238</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"239\"><span class=\"c-no\">239</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"240\"><span class=\"c-no\">240</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> call(  <span class=\"c-com\"># type: ignore[override]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"241\"><span class=\"c-no\">241</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"242\"><span class=\"c-no\">242</span><span class=\"c-src\">        query: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"243\"><span class=\"c-no\">243</span><span class=\"c-src\">        knowledge_bases: list[str] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"244\"><span class=\"c-no\">244</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; ToolChunk:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"245\"><span class=\"c-no\">245</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Search the selected knowledge bases <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> the results</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"246\"><span class=\"c-no\">246</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> content blocks.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"247\"><span class=\"c-no\">247</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"248\"><span class=\"c-no\">248</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"249\"><span class=\"c-no\">249</span><span class=\"c-src\">            query (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"250\"><span class=\"c-no\">250</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The natural-language search query.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"251\"><span class=\"c-no\">251</span><span class=\"c-src\">            knowledge_bases (`list[str] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"252\"><span class=\"c-no\">252</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Optional subset of knowledge bases to query, by name.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"253\"><span class=\"c-no\">253</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` searches every equipped knowledge base.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"254\"><span class=\"c-no\">254</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"255\"><span class=\"c-no\">255</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"256\"><span class=\"c-no\">256</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `ToolChunk`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"257\"><span class=\"c-no\">257</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The formatted search results, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> a notice when</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"258\"><span class=\"c-no\">258</span><span class=\"c-src\">                nothing relevant <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> found.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"259\"><span class=\"c-no\">259</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"260\"><span class=\"c-no\">260</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> knowledge_bases <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"261\"><span class=\"c-no\">261</span><span class=\"c-src\">            targets = list(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"262\"><span class=\"c-no\">262</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"263\"><span class=\"c-no\">263</span><span class=\"c-src\">            wanted = set(knowledge_bases)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"264\"><span class=\"c-no\">264</span><span class=\"c-src\">            targets = [kb <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> kb <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> kb.name <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> wanted]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"265\"><span class=\"c-no\">265</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"266\"><span class=\"c-no\">266</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> targets:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"267\"><span class=\"c-no\">267</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> ToolChunk(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"268\"><span class=\"c-no\">268</span><span class=\"c-src\">                content=[TextBlock(text=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;No relevant content found.&quot;</span>)],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"269\"><span class=\"c-no\">269</span><span class=\"c-src\">                state=ToolResultState.SUCCESS,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"270\"><span class=\"c-no\">270</span><span class=\"c-src\">                is_last=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"271\"><span class=\"c-no\">271</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"272\"><span class=\"c-no\">272</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"273\"><span class=\"c-no\">273</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"274\"><span class=\"c-no\">274</span><span class=\"c-src\">            results = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> _search_across(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"275\"><span class=\"c-no\">275</span><span class=\"c-src\">                targets,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"276\"><span class=\"c-no\">276</span><span class=\"c-src\">                [query],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"277\"><span class=\"c-no\">277</span><span class=\"c-src\">                top_k=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._top_k,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"278\"><span class=\"c-no\">278</span><span class=\"c-src\">                score_threshold=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._score_threshold,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"279\"><span class=\"c-no\">279</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"280\"><span class=\"c-no\">280</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> e:  <span class=\"c-com\"># pylint: disable=broad-except</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"281\"><span class=\"c-no\">281</span><span class=\"c-src\">            logger.exception(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;search_knowledge failed.&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"282\"><span class=\"c-no\">282</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> ToolChunk(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"283\"><span class=\"c-no\">283</span><span class=\"c-src\">                content=[TextBlock(text=f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Search failed: {e}&quot;</span>)],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"284\"><span class=\"c-no\">284</span><span class=\"c-src\">                state=ToolResultState.ERROR,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"285\"><span class=\"c-no\">285</span><span class=\"c-src\">                is_last=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"286\"><span class=\"c-no\">286</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"287\"><span class=\"c-no\">287</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"288\"><span class=\"c-no\">288</span><span class=\"c-src\">        blocks = _format_results(results)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"289\"><span class=\"c-no\">289</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> blocks:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"290\"><span class=\"c-no\">290</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> ToolChunk(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"291\"><span class=\"c-no\">291</span><span class=\"c-src\">                content=[TextBlock(text=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;No relevant content found.&quot;</span>)],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"292\"><span class=\"c-no\">292</span><span class=\"c-src\">                state=ToolResultState.SUCCESS,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"293\"><span class=\"c-no\">293</span><span class=\"c-src\">                is_last=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"294\"><span class=\"c-no\">294</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"295\"><span class=\"c-no\">295</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> ToolChunk(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"296\"><span class=\"c-no\">296</span><span class=\"c-src\">            content=blocks,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"297\"><span class=\"c-no\">297</span><span class=\"c-src\">            state=ToolResultState.SUCCESS,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"298\"><span class=\"c-no\">298</span><span class=\"c-src\">            is_last=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"299\"><span class=\"c-no\">299</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"300\"><span class=\"c-no\">300</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"301\"><span class=\"c-no\">301</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"302\"><span class=\"c-no\">302</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># ---------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"303\"><span class=\"c-no\">303</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># Shared helpers — used by both the tool (agentic mode) and the</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"304\"><span class=\"c-no\">304</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># middleware&#x27;s static-mode injection path.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"305\"><span class=\"c-no\">305</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># ---------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"306\"><span class=\"c-no\">306</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"307\"><span class=\"c-no\">307</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"308\"><span class=\"c-no\">308</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _search_across(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"309\"><span class=\"c-no\">309</span><span class=\"c-src\">    knowledge_bases: Sequence[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;KnowledgeBase&quot;</span>],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"310\"><span class=\"c-no\">310</span><span class=\"c-src\">    queries: Sequence[str | TextBlock | DataBlock],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"311\"><span class=\"c-no\">311</span><span class=\"c-src\">    top_k: int,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"312\"><span class=\"c-no\">312</span><span class=\"c-src\">    score_threshold: float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"313\"><span class=\"c-no\">313</span><span class=\"c-src\">) -&gt; list[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;VectorSearchResult&quot;</span>]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"314\"><span class=\"c-no\">314</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Search every knowledge base concurrently <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> merge the results.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"315\"><span class=\"c-no\">315</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"316\"><span class=\"c-no\">316</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Each knowledge base handles its own filtering — it silently drops</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"317\"><span class=\"c-no\">317</span><span class=\"c-src\">    :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`DataBlock` inputs when its embedding model <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"318\"><span class=\"c-no\">318</span><span class=\"c-src\">    multimodal — so callers can <span class=\"c-kw\">pass</span> the same query list to every</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"319\"><span class=\"c-no\">319</span><span class=\"c-src\">    knowledge base without per-KB pre-filtering.  Per-KB hits are</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"320\"><span class=\"c-no\">320</span><span class=\"c-src\">    flattened, sorted by descending score, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> truncated to ``top_k``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"321\"><span class=\"c-no\">321</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"322\"><span class=\"c-no\">322</span><span class=\"c-src\">    .. note::</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"323\"><span class=\"c-no\">323</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Scores <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> knowledge bases <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> different embedding models</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"324\"><span class=\"c-no\">324</span><span class=\"c-src\">        are <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> strictly comparable; this merge sorts by raw score.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"325\"><span class=\"c-no\">325</span><span class=\"c-src\">        For mixed-embedding deployments where that matters, switch to</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"326\"><span class=\"c-no\">326</span><span class=\"c-src\">        a rank-based fusion (e.g. RRF) — each per-KB</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"327\"><span class=\"c-no\">327</span><span class=\"c-src\">        :meth:`KnowledgeBase.search` already returns ordered results.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"328\"><span class=\"c-no\">328</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"329\"><span class=\"c-no\">329</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"330\"><span class=\"c-no\">330</span><span class=\"c-src\">        knowledge_bases (`list[KnowledgeBase]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"331\"><span class=\"c-no\">331</span><span class=\"c-src\">            The knowledge bases to query.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"332\"><span class=\"c-no\">332</span><span class=\"c-src\">        queries (`list[str | TextBlock | DataBlock]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"333\"><span class=\"c-no\">333</span><span class=\"c-src\">            The query inputs.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"334\"><span class=\"c-no\">334</span><span class=\"c-src\">        top_k (`int`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"335\"><span class=\"c-no\">335</span><span class=\"c-src\">            Maximum number of results after merging.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"336\"><span class=\"c-no\">336</span><span class=\"c-src\">        score_threshold (`float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"337\"><span class=\"c-no\">337</span><span class=\"c-src\">            Forwarded to each :meth:`KnowledgeBase.search` call.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"338\"><span class=\"c-no\">338</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"339\"><span class=\"c-no\">339</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"340\"><span class=\"c-no\">340</span><span class=\"c-src\">        `list[VectorSearchResult]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"341\"><span class=\"c-no\">341</span><span class=\"c-src\">            At most ``top_k`` hits across all knowledge bases.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"342\"><span class=\"c-no\">342</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"343\"><span class=\"c-no\">343</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> queries <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> knowledge_bases:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"344\"><span class=\"c-no\">344</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"345\"><span class=\"c-no\">345</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"346\"><span class=\"c-no\">346</span><span class=\"c-src\">    queries_list = list(queries)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"347\"><span class=\"c-no\">347</span><span class=\"c-src\">    per_kb = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> asyncio.gather(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"348\"><span class=\"c-no\">348</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"349\"><span class=\"c-no\">349</span><span class=\"c-src\">            kb.search(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"350\"><span class=\"c-no\">350</span><span class=\"c-src\">                queries=queries_list,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"351\"><span class=\"c-no\">351</span><span class=\"c-src\">                top_k=top_k,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"352\"><span class=\"c-no\">352</span><span class=\"c-src\">                score_threshold=score_threshold,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"353\"><span class=\"c-no\">353</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"354\"><span class=\"c-no\">354</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> kb <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> knowledge_bases</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"355\"><span class=\"c-no\">355</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"356\"><span class=\"c-no\">356</span><span class=\"c-src\">    )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"357\"><span class=\"c-no\">357</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"358\"><span class=\"c-no\">358</span><span class=\"c-src\">    merged = [r <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> sub <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> per_kb <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> r <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> sub]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"359\"><span class=\"c-no\">359</span><span class=\"c-src\">    merged.sort(key=<span class=\"c-kw\">lambda</span> r: r.score, reverse=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"360\"><span class=\"c-no\">360</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> merged[:top_k]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"361\"><span class=\"c-no\">361</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"362\"><span class=\"c-no\">362</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"363\"><span class=\"c-no\">363</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _format_results(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"364\"><span class=\"c-no\">364</span><span class=\"c-src\">    results: list[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;VectorSearchResult&quot;</span>],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"365\"><span class=\"c-no\">365</span><span class=\"c-src\">) -&gt; list[TextBlock | DataBlock]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"366\"><span class=\"c-no\">366</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Render search results <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> a numbered, cited list of blocks.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"367\"><span class=\"c-no\">367</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"368\"><span class=\"c-no\">368</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Every result becomes ``[N] (source: ...)`` followed by its chunk</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"369\"><span class=\"c-no\">369</span><span class=\"c-src\">    content (text inlined, multimodal blocks kept <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> standalone</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"370\"><span class=\"c-no\">370</span><span class=\"c-src\">    :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`DataBlock` entries).  Adjacent text fragments are merged</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"371\"><span class=\"c-no\">371</span><span class=\"c-src\">    into a single :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`TextBlock` so downstream consumers see one</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"372\"><span class=\"c-no\">372</span><span class=\"c-src\">    contiguous text block instead of many small ones.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"373\"><span class=\"c-no\">373</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"374\"><span class=\"c-no\">374</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"375\"><span class=\"c-no\">375</span><span class=\"c-src\">        results (`list[VectorSearchResult]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"376\"><span class=\"c-no\">376</span><span class=\"c-src\">            The search results to format.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"377\"><span class=\"c-no\">377</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"378\"><span class=\"c-no\">378</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"379\"><span class=\"c-no\">379</span><span class=\"c-src\">        `list[TextBlock | DataBlock]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"380\"><span class=\"c-no\">380</span><span class=\"c-src\">            The formatted blocks; empty list when ``results`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"381\"><span class=\"c-no\">381</span><span class=\"c-src\">            empty.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"382\"><span class=\"c-no\">382</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"383\"><span class=\"c-no\">383</span><span class=\"c-src\">    entries: list[TextBlock | DataBlock] = []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"384\"><span class=\"c-no\">384</span><span class=\"c-src\">    last = len(results)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"385\"><span class=\"c-no\">385</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> index, result <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> enumerate(results, start=1):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"386\"><span class=\"c-no\">386</span><span class=\"c-src\">        prefix = f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;[{index}] (source: {result.chunk.source})\\n&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"387\"><span class=\"c-no\">387</span><span class=\"c-src\">        block = deepcopy(result.chunk.content)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"388\"><span class=\"c-no\">388</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> isinstance(block, TextBlock):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"389\"><span class=\"c-no\">389</span><span class=\"c-src\">            block.text = prefix + block.text</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"390\"><span class=\"c-no\">390</span><span class=\"c-src\">            entries.append(block)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"391\"><span class=\"c-no\">391</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"392\"><span class=\"c-no\">392</span><span class=\"c-src\">            entries.append(TextBlock(text=prefix))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"393\"><span class=\"c-no\">393</span><span class=\"c-src\">            entries.append(block)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"394\"><span class=\"c-no\">394</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> index != last:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"395\"><span class=\"c-no\">395</span><span class=\"c-src\">            entries.append(TextBlock(text=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;\\n\\n&quot;</span>))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"396\"><span class=\"c-no\">396</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"397\"><span class=\"c-no\">397</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Coalesce adjacent TextBlocks into one to keep the consumer-facing</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"398\"><span class=\"c-no\">398</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># block list tight.  We build fresh TextBlocks rather than mutating</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"399\"><span class=\"c-no\">399</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># the deep copied ones to avoid aliasing the originals.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"400\"><span class=\"c-no\">400</span><span class=\"c-src\">    merged: list[TextBlock | DataBlock] = []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"401\"><span class=\"c-no\">401</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> entry <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> entries:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"402\"><span class=\"c-no\">402</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> (</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"403\"><span class=\"c-no\">403</span><span class=\"c-src\">            isinstance(entry, TextBlock)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"404\"><span class=\"c-no\">404</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> merged</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"405\"><span class=\"c-no\">405</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> isinstance(merged[-1], TextBlock)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"406\"><span class=\"c-no\">406</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"407\"><span class=\"c-no\">407</span><span class=\"c-src\">            merged[-1] = TextBlock(text=merged[-1].text + entry.text)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"408\"><span class=\"c-no\">408</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"409\"><span class=\"c-no\">409</span><span class=\"c-src\">            merged.append(entry)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"410\"><span class=\"c-no\">410</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> merged</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"411\"><span class=\"c-no\">411</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"412\"><span class=\"c-no\">412</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"413\"><span class=\"c-no\">413</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _wrap_hint(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"414\"><span class=\"c-no\">414</span><span class=\"c-src\">    template: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"415\"><span class=\"c-no\">415</span><span class=\"c-src\">    blocks: list[TextBlock | DataBlock],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"416\"><span class=\"c-no\">416</span><span class=\"c-src\">) -&gt; str | list[TextBlock | DataBlock]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"417\"><span class=\"c-no\">417</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Substitute ``{context}`` <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> ``template`` <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> the rendered blocks.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"418\"><span class=\"c-no\">418</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"419\"><span class=\"c-no\">419</span><span class=\"c-src\">    When every block <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> a :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`TextBlock` the result <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> a single</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"420\"><span class=\"c-no\">420</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ``str`` (cheap, no block overhead).  When the blocks include</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"421\"><span class=\"c-no\">421</span><span class=\"c-src\">    multimodal :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`DataBlock` content the template <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> split on</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"422\"><span class=\"c-no\">422</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ``{context}`` <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> the surrounding text <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> prepended / appended <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"423\"><span class=\"c-no\">423</span><span class=\"c-src\">    :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`TextBlock` items, producing a ``list[TextBlock |</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"424\"><span class=\"c-no\">424</span><span class=\"c-src\">    DataBlock]`` that preserves the binary payloads end-to-end.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"425\"><span class=\"c-no\">425</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"426\"><span class=\"c-no\">426</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"427\"><span class=\"c-no\">427</span><span class=\"c-src\">        template (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"428\"><span class=\"c-no\">428</span><span class=\"c-src\">            Wrapper template <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> a single ``{context}`` placeholder.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"429\"><span class=\"c-no\">429</span><span class=\"c-src\">        blocks (`list[TextBlock | DataBlock]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"430\"><span class=\"c-no\">430</span><span class=\"c-src\">            The formatted search blocks to wrap.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"431\"><span class=\"c-no\">431</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"432\"><span class=\"c-no\">432</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"433\"><span class=\"c-no\">433</span><span class=\"c-src\">        `str | list[TextBlock | DataBlock]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"434\"><span class=\"c-no\">434</span><span class=\"c-src\">            A plain string <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> text-only payloads, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> a list of blocks</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"435\"><span class=\"c-no\">435</span><span class=\"c-src\">            when binary payloads are involved.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"436\"><span class=\"c-no\">436</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"437\"><span class=\"c-no\">437</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> all(isinstance(b, TextBlock) <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> b <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> blocks):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"438\"><span class=\"c-no\">438</span><span class=\"c-src\">        joined = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span>.join(b.text <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> b <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> blocks)  <span class=\"c-com\"># type: ignore[union-attr]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"439\"><span class=\"c-no\">439</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> template.format(context=joined)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"440\"><span class=\"c-no\">440</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"441\"><span class=\"c-no\">441</span><span class=\"c-src\">    prefix, _, end = template.partition(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;{context}&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"442\"><span class=\"c-no\">442</span><span class=\"c-src\">    wrapped: list[TextBlock | DataBlock] = list(blocks)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"443\"><span class=\"c-no\">443</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> prefix:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"444\"><span class=\"c-no\">444</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> isinstance(wrapped[0], TextBlock):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"445\"><span class=\"c-no\">445</span><span class=\"c-src\">            wrapped[0] = TextBlock(text=prefix + wrapped[0].text)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"446\"><span class=\"c-no\">446</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"447\"><span class=\"c-no\">447</span><span class=\"c-src\">            wrapped.insert(0, TextBlock(text=prefix))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"448\"><span class=\"c-no\">448</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> end:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"449\"><span class=\"c-no\">449</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> isinstance(wrapped[-1], TextBlock):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"450\"><span class=\"c-no\">450</span><span class=\"c-src\">            wrapped[-1] = TextBlock(text=wrapped[-1].text + end)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"451\"><span class=\"c-no\">451</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"452\"><span class=\"c-no\">452</span><span class=\"c-src\">            wrapped.append(TextBlock(text=end))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"453\"><span class=\"c-no\">453</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> wrapped</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"454\"><span class=\"c-no\">454</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"455\"><span class=\"c-no\">455</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"456\"><span class=\"c-no\">456</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> RAGMiddleware(MiddlewareBase):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"457\"><span class=\"c-no\">457</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Middleware that integrates knowledge-base search into the agent.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"458\"><span class=\"c-no\">458</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"459\"><span class=\"c-no\">459</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Constructed <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> a list of :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`~agentscope.rag.KnowledgeBase`</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"460\"><span class=\"c-no\">460</span><span class=\"c-src\">    handles — each carrying its own embedding model, vector store, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"461\"><span class=\"c-no\">461</span><span class=\"c-src\">    metadata filter.  The middleware does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> own these resources; it</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"462\"><span class=\"c-no\">462</span><span class=\"c-src\">    only orchestrates search against them.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"463\"><span class=\"c-no\">463</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"464\"><span class=\"c-no\">464</span><span class=\"c-src\">    .. code-block:: python</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"465\"><span class=\"c-no\">465</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"466\"><span class=\"c-no\">466</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Automatic injection (static mode)</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"467\"><span class=\"c-no\">467</span><span class=\"c-src\">        middleware = RAGMiddleware(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"468\"><span class=\"c-no\">468</span><span class=\"c-src\">            knowledge_bases=[kb1, kb2],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"469\"><span class=\"c-no\">469</span><span class=\"c-src\">            search_config=SearchConfig(mode=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;static&quot;</span>),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"470\"><span class=\"c-no\">470</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"471\"><span class=\"c-no\">471</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"472\"><span class=\"c-no\">472</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Agent-driven search (agentic mode, the default)</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"473\"><span class=\"c-no\">473</span><span class=\"c-src\">        middleware = RAGMiddleware(knowledge_bases=[kb1, kb2])</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"474\"><span class=\"c-no\">474</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"475\"><span class=\"c-no\">475</span><span class=\"c-src\">        agent = Agent(..., middlewares=[middleware], ...)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"476\"><span class=\"c-no\">476</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"477\"><span class=\"c-no\">477</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"478\"><span class=\"c-no\">478</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> Parameters(BaseModel):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"479\"><span class=\"c-no\">479</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;User-tunable knowledge-base search parameters of</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"480\"><span class=\"c-no\">480</span><span class=\"c-src\">        :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`RAGMiddleware`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"481\"><span class=\"c-no\">481</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"482\"><span class=\"c-no\">482</span><span class=\"c-src\">        The fields here are exactly the keys the hosted service persists</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"483\"><span class=\"c-no\">483</span><span class=\"c-src\">        into ``SessionKnowledgeConfig.parameters`` <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> the keys</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"484\"><span class=\"c-no\">484</span><span class=\"c-src\">        :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`RAGMiddleware` accepts <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> ``search_config``.  Every field</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"485\"><span class=\"c-no\">485</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> annotated <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> a ``title`` <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> ``description`` so the front-end</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"486\"><span class=\"c-no\">486</span><span class=\"c-src\">        can render them <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> labels <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> tooltips via</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"487\"><span class=\"c-no\">487</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``model_json_schema()``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"488\"><span class=\"c-no\">488</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"489\"><span class=\"c-no\">489</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"490\"><span class=\"c-no\">490</span><span class=\"c-src\">        model_config = ConfigDict(frozen=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"491\"><span class=\"c-no\">491</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"492\"><span class=\"c-no\">492</span><span class=\"c-src\">        mode: Literal[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;static&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;agentic&quot;</span>] = Field(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"493\"><span class=\"c-no\">493</span><span class=\"c-src\">            default=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;agentic&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"494\"><span class=\"c-no\">494</span><span class=\"c-src\">            title=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Mode&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"495\"><span class=\"c-no\">495</span><span class=\"c-src\">            description=(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"496\"><span class=\"c-no\">496</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Retrieval is either agentic, letting the Agent decide when &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"497\"><span class=\"c-no\">497</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;to retrieve, or static, triggering on every user input.&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"498\"><span class=\"c-no\">498</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"499\"><span class=\"c-no\">499</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"500\"><span class=\"c-no\">500</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"501\"><span class=\"c-no\">501</span><span class=\"c-src\">        top_k: int = Field(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"502\"><span class=\"c-no\">502</span><span class=\"c-src\">            default=5,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"503\"><span class=\"c-no\">503</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ge=1,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"504\"><span class=\"c-no\">504</span><span class=\"c-src\">            le=50,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"505\"><span class=\"c-no\">505</span><span class=\"c-src\">            title=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Top K&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"506\"><span class=\"c-no\">506</span><span class=\"c-src\">            description=(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"507\"><span class=\"c-no\">507</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Maximum number of chunks returned per search, across all &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"508\"><span class=\"c-no\">508</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;configured knowledge bases.&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"509\"><span class=\"c-no\">509</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"510\"><span class=\"c-no\">510</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"511\"><span class=\"c-no\">511</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"512\"><span class=\"c-no\">512</span><span class=\"c-src\">        score_threshold: float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = Field(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"513\"><span class=\"c-no\">513</span><span class=\"c-src\">            default=<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"514\"><span class=\"c-no\">514</span><span class=\"c-src\">            title=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Score Threshold&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"515\"><span class=\"c-no\">515</span><span class=\"c-src\">            description=(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"516\"><span class=\"c-no\">516</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Minimum similarity score for a hit to be kept. Leave &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"517\"><span class=\"c-no\">517</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;empty to disable filtering.&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"518\"><span class=\"c-no\">518</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"519\"><span class=\"c-no\">519</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"520\"><span class=\"c-no\">520</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"521\"><span class=\"c-no\">521</span><span class=\"c-src\">        emit_hint_event: bool = Field(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"522\"><span class=\"c-no\">522</span><span class=\"c-src\">            default=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"523\"><span class=\"c-no\">523</span><span class=\"c-src\">            title=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Show matched chunks in chat&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"524\"><span class=\"c-no\">524</span><span class=\"c-src\">            description=(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"525\"><span class=\"c-no\">525</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Emit a `HintBlockEvent` in static mode so the front-end &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"526\"><span class=\"c-no\">526</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;can display the matched snippets to the user.&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"527\"><span class=\"c-no\">527</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"528\"><span class=\"c-no\">528</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"529\"><span class=\"c-no\">529</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"530\"><span class=\"c-no\">530</span><span class=\"c-src\">        persist_hint: bool = Field(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"531\"><span class=\"c-no\">531</span><span class=\"c-src\">            default=<span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"532\"><span class=\"c-no\">532</span><span class=\"c-src\">            title=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Persist Hint&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"533\"><span class=\"c-no\">533</span><span class=\"c-src\">            description=(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"534\"><span class=\"c-no\">534</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;In `static` mode, keep the injected hint block in the &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"535\"><span class=\"c-no\">535</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;agent context instead of removing it right after the &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"536\"><span class=\"c-no\">536</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;model call.&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"537\"><span class=\"c-no\">537</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"538\"><span class=\"c-no\">538</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"539\"><span class=\"c-no\">539</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"540\"><span class=\"c-no\">540</span><span class=\"c-src\">        hint_template: SkipJsonSchema[str] = Field(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"541\"><span class=\"c-no\">541</span><span class=\"c-src\">            default=_DEFAULT_HINT_TEMPLATE,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"542\"><span class=\"c-no\">542</span><span class=\"c-src\">            title=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Hint template&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"543\"><span class=\"c-no\">543</span><span class=\"c-src\">            description=(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"544\"><span class=\"c-no\">544</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Template wrapping the formatted search results in static &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"545\"><span class=\"c-no\">545</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;mode, with a `{context}` placeholder.&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"546\"><span class=\"c-no\">546</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"547\"><span class=\"c-no\">547</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"548\"><span class=\"c-no\">548</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"549\"><span class=\"c-no\">549</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># ``hint_template`` is intentionally hidden from the JSON Schema</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"550\"><span class=\"c-no\">550</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># exposed to the dock UI: the wrapper text is part of the</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"551\"><span class=\"c-no\">551</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># middleware&#x27;s prompt contract and exposing it through the dock</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"552\"><span class=\"c-no\">552</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># invites session-by-session prompt drift.  It is still accepted</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"553\"><span class=\"c-no\">553</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># for programmatic use.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"554\"><span class=\"c-no\">554</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"555\"><span class=\"c-no\">555</span><span class=\"c-src\">        @field_validator(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;hint_template&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"556\"><span class=\"c-no\">556</span><span class=\"c-src\">        @classmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"557\"><span class=\"c-no\">557</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _validate_hint_template(cls, value: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"558\"><span class=\"c-no\">558</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Reject templates <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> anything other than exactly one</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"559\"><span class=\"c-no\">559</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ``{context}`` placeholder — :func:`_wrap_hint` substitutes on</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"560\"><span class=\"c-no\">560</span><span class=\"c-src\">            the first occurrence, so zero placeholders silently drop the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"561\"><span class=\"c-no\">561</span><span class=\"c-src\">            matched content <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> multiple placeholders duplicate it.<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"562\"><span class=\"c-no\">562</span><span class=\"c-src\">            count = value.count(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;{context}&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"563\"><span class=\"c-no\">563</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> count != 1:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"564\"><span class=\"c-no\">564</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">raise</span> ValueError(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"565\"><span class=\"c-no\">565</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;hint_template must contain exactly one &#x27;{context}&#x27; &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"566\"><span class=\"c-no\">566</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;placeholder; found {count}.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"567\"><span class=\"c-no\">567</span><span class=\"c-src\">                )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"568\"><span class=\"c-no\">568</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> value</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"569\"><span class=\"c-no\">569</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"570\"><span class=\"c-no\">570</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __init__(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"571\"><span class=\"c-no\">571</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"572\"><span class=\"c-no\">572</span><span class=\"c-src\">        knowledge_bases: list[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;KnowledgeBase&quot;</span>],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"573\"><span class=\"c-no\">573</span><span class=\"c-src\">        parameters: <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;RAGMiddleware.Parameters | None&quot;</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"574\"><span class=\"c-no\">574</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"575\"><span class=\"c-no\">575</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Initialize the RAG middleware.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"576\"><span class=\"c-no\">576</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"577\"><span class=\"c-no\">577</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"578\"><span class=\"c-no\">578</span><span class=\"c-src\">            knowledge_bases (`list[KnowledgeBase]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"579\"><span class=\"c-no\">579</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The knowledge bases this agent searches.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"580\"><span class=\"c-no\">580</span><span class=\"c-src\">            parameters (`RAGMiddleware.Parameters | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"581\"><span class=\"c-no\">581</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Search-time knobs (mode, top_k, score threshold, hint</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"582\"><span class=\"c-no\">582</span><span class=\"c-src\">                behaviour).  ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` uses the defaults of</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"583\"><span class=\"c-no\">583</span><span class=\"c-src\">                :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`SearchConfig`.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"584\"><span class=\"c-no\">584</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"585\"><span class=\"c-no\">585</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases = knowledge_bases</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"586\"><span class=\"c-no\">586</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters = parameters <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> RAGMiddleware.Parameters()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"587\"><span class=\"c-no\">587</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Static-mode reply scratchpad: populated by ``on_reply`` and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"588\"><span class=\"c-no\">588</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># consumed by ``on_reasoning`` so the auto-search can use the</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"589\"><span class=\"c-no\">589</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># original reply inputs (which are no longer in</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"590\"><span class=\"c-no\">590</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># ``agent.state.context`` by the time ``on_reasoning`` runs in</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"591\"><span class=\"c-no\">591</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># a tool-call loop).  Cleared in ``on_reply``&#x27;s finally.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"592\"><span class=\"c-no\">592</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._cached_inputs: list[TextBlock | DataBlock] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"593\"><span class=\"c-no\">593</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"594\"><span class=\"c-no\">594</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"595\"><span class=\"c-no\">595</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Agentic mode — expose the search tool</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"596\"><span class=\"c-no\">596</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"597\"><span class=\"c-no\">597</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"598\"><span class=\"c-no\">598</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> list_tools(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; list[ToolBase]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"599\"><span class=\"c-no\">599</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Expose the search tool in ``&quot;</span>agentic&quot;`` mode.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"600\"><span class=\"c-no\">600</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"601\"><span class=\"c-no\">601</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"602\"><span class=\"c-no\">602</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `list[ToolBase]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"603\"><span class=\"c-no\">603</span><span class=\"c-src\">                A single ``search_knowledge`` tool <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> ``<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;agentic&quot;</span>``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"604\"><span class=\"c-no\">604</span><span class=\"c-src\">                mode; an empty list <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> ``<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;static&quot;</span>`` mode.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"605\"><span class=\"c-no\">605</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"606\"><span class=\"c-no\">606</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.mode == <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;agentic&quot;</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"607\"><span class=\"c-no\">607</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> [</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"608\"><span class=\"c-no\">608</span><span class=\"c-src\">                _SearchKnowledgeTool(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"609\"><span class=\"c-no\">609</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"610\"><span class=\"c-no\">610</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    top_k=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.top_k,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"611\"><span class=\"c-no\">611</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    score_threshold=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.score_threshold,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"612\"><span class=\"c-no\">612</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"613\"><span class=\"c-no\">613</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"614\"><span class=\"c-no\">614</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"615\"><span class=\"c-no\">615</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"616\"><span class=\"c-no\">616</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"617\"><span class=\"c-no\">617</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Static mode — capture inputs in on_reply, search in on_reasoning</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"618\"><span class=\"c-no\">618</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"619\"><span class=\"c-no\">619</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"620\"><span class=\"c-no\">620</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> on_reply(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"621\"><span class=\"c-no\">621</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"622\"><span class=\"c-no\">622</span><span class=\"c-src\">        agent: <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Agent&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"623\"><span class=\"c-no\">623</span><span class=\"c-src\">        input_kwargs: dict,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"624\"><span class=\"c-no\">624</span><span class=\"c-src\">        next_handler: Callable[..., AsyncGenerator],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"625\"><span class=\"c-no\">625</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; AsyncGenerator:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"626\"><span class=\"c-no\">626</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Cache reply inputs <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> the static-mode search.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"627\"><span class=\"c-no\">627</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"628\"><span class=\"c-no\">628</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``on_reasoning`` runs *after* the agent has potentially</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"629\"><span class=\"c-no\">629</span><span class=\"c-src\">        consumed the inputs <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> started its own reply, so it cannot</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"630\"><span class=\"c-no\">630</span><span class=\"c-src\">        recover them <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ``agent.state.context`` reliably.  This</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"631\"><span class=\"c-no\">631</span><span class=\"c-src\">        method captures them on entry <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> clears the cache when the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"632\"><span class=\"c-no\">632</span><span class=\"c-src\">        reply finishes.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"633\"><span class=\"c-no\">633</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"634\"><span class=\"c-no\">634</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"635\"><span class=\"c-no\">635</span><span class=\"c-src\">            agent (`Agent`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"636\"><span class=\"c-no\">636</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The executing agent.  Unused, but part of the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"637\"><span class=\"c-no\">637</span><span class=\"c-src\">                middleware contract.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"638\"><span class=\"c-no\">638</span><span class=\"c-src\">            input_kwargs (`dict`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"639\"><span class=\"c-no\">639</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Reply input kwargs (``inputs``, plus any extras);</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"640\"><span class=\"c-no\">640</span><span class=\"c-src\">                forwarded unchanged.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"641\"><span class=\"c-no\">641</span><span class=\"c-src\">            next_handler (`Callable[..., AsyncGenerator]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"642\"><span class=\"c-no\">642</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The downstream middleware <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> core reply logic.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"643\"><span class=\"c-no\">643</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"644\"><span class=\"c-no\">644</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Yields:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"645\"><span class=\"c-no\">645</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `Any`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"646\"><span class=\"c-no\">646</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Whatever ``next_handler`` yields.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"647\"><span class=\"c-no\">647</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"648\"><span class=\"c-no\">648</span><span class=\"c-src\">        inputs = input_kwargs.get(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;inputs&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"649\"><span class=\"c-no\">649</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"650\"><span class=\"c-no\">650</span><span class=\"c-src\">        msgs: list[Msg] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"651\"><span class=\"c-no\">651</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> isinstance(inputs, Msg):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"652\"><span class=\"c-no\">652</span><span class=\"c-src\">            msgs = [inputs]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"653\"><span class=\"c-no\">653</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">elif</span> isinstance(inputs, list) <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> all(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"654\"><span class=\"c-no\">654</span><span class=\"c-src\">            isinstance(m, Msg) <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> m <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> inputs</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"655\"><span class=\"c-no\">655</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"656\"><span class=\"c-no\">656</span><span class=\"c-src\">            msgs = inputs</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"657\"><span class=\"c-no\">657</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"658\"><span class=\"c-no\">658</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> msgs:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"659\"><span class=\"c-no\">659</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># Deepcopy because we are about to mutate the first text block of</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"660\"><span class=\"c-no\">660</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># each message to prepend the speaker name — never touch the</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"661\"><span class=\"c-no\">661</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># caller&#x27;s message objects.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"662\"><span class=\"c-no\">662</span><span class=\"c-src\">            msgs = deepcopy(msgs)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"663\"><span class=\"c-no\">663</span><span class=\"c-src\">            blocks: list[TextBlock | DataBlock] = []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"664\"><span class=\"c-no\">664</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> msg <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> msgs:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"665\"><span class=\"c-no\">665</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> msg.content:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"666\"><span class=\"c-no\">666</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"667\"><span class=\"c-no\">667</span><span class=\"c-src\">                speaker = f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;{msg.name}: &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"668\"><span class=\"c-no\">668</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> isinstance(msg.content[0], TextBlock):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"669\"><span class=\"c-no\">669</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    msg.content[0].text = speaker + msg.content[0].text</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"670\"><span class=\"c-no\">670</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"671\"><span class=\"c-no\">671</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    blocks.append(TextBlock(text=speaker))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"672\"><span class=\"c-no\">672</span><span class=\"c-src\">                blocks.extend(msg.content)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"673\"><span class=\"c-no\">673</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"674\"><span class=\"c-no\">674</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._cached_inputs = blocks</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"675\"><span class=\"c-no\">675</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"676\"><span class=\"c-no\">676</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"677\"><span class=\"c-no\">677</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> evt <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> next_handler(**input_kwargs):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"678\"><span class=\"c-no\">678</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span> evt</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"679\"><span class=\"c-no\">679</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">finally</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"680\"><span class=\"c-no\">680</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._cached_inputs = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"681\"><span class=\"c-no\">681</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"682\"><span class=\"c-no\">682</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> on_reasoning(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"683\"><span class=\"c-no\">683</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"684\"><span class=\"c-no\">684</span><span class=\"c-src\">        agent: <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Agent&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"685\"><span class=\"c-no\">685</span><span class=\"c-src\">        input_kwargs: dict,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"686\"><span class=\"c-no\">686</span><span class=\"c-src\">        next_handler: Callable[..., AsyncGenerator],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"687\"><span class=\"c-no\">687</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; AsyncGenerator:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"688\"><span class=\"c-no\">688</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Inject a one-shot RAG hint on the first reasoning step.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"689\"><span class=\"c-no\">689</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"690\"><span class=\"c-no\">690</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Only active <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> ``<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;static&quot;</span>`` mode <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> only when</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"691\"><span class=\"c-no\">691</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``agent.state.cur_iter == 0`` — i.e. the first reasoning cycle</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"692\"><span class=\"c-no\">692</span><span class=\"c-src\">        of a reply.  Subsequent reasoning iterations (tool-call</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"693\"><span class=\"c-no\">693</span><span class=\"c-src\">        rounds) skip the search so the agent does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> re-embed <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"694\"><span class=\"c-no\">694</span><span class=\"c-src\">        re-inject <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> every iteration.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"695\"><span class=\"c-no\">695</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"696\"><span class=\"c-no\">696</span><span class=\"c-src\">        When ``persist_hint`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> ``<span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>`` (the default) the injected</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"697\"><span class=\"c-no\">697</span><span class=\"c-src\">        block <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> removed <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> the context right after the reasoning</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"698\"><span class=\"c-no\">698</span><span class=\"c-src\">        step it participated <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> — keyed on the block&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s id so other</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"699\"><span class=\"c-no\">699</span><span class=\"c-src\">        middlewares can append their own blocks to the same carrier</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"700\"><span class=\"c-no\">700</span><span class=\"c-src\">        message without interfering.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"701\"><span class=\"c-no\">701</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"702\"><span class=\"c-no\">702</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"703\"><span class=\"c-no\">703</span><span class=\"c-src\">            agent (`Agent`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"704\"><span class=\"c-no\">704</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The executing agent whose ``state.context`` receives</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"705\"><span class=\"c-no\">705</span><span class=\"c-src\">                the hint.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"706\"><span class=\"c-no\">706</span><span class=\"c-src\">            input_kwargs (`dict`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"707\"><span class=\"c-no\">707</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Reasoning input kwargs; forwarded unchanged.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"708\"><span class=\"c-no\">708</span><span class=\"c-src\">            next_handler (`Callable[..., AsyncGenerator]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"709\"><span class=\"c-no\">709</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The downstream middleware <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> core reasoning logic.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"710\"><span class=\"c-no\">710</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"711\"><span class=\"c-no\">711</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Yields:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"712\"><span class=\"c-no\">712</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `Any`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"713\"><span class=\"c-no\">713</span><span class=\"c-src\">                An optional :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`HintBlockEvent` followed by events</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"714\"><span class=\"c-no\">714</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> downstream.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"715\"><span class=\"c-no\">715</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"716\"><span class=\"c-no\">716</span><span class=\"c-src\">        hint: HintBlock | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"717\"><span class=\"c-no\">717</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"718\"><span class=\"c-no\">718</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> (</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"719\"><span class=\"c-no\">719</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.mode == <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;static&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"720\"><span class=\"c-no\">720</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> agent.state.cur_iter == 0</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"721\"><span class=\"c-no\">721</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._cached_inputs</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"722\"><span class=\"c-no\">722</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"723\"><span class=\"c-no\">723</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"724\"><span class=\"c-no\">724</span><span class=\"c-src\">                results = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> _search_across(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"725\"><span class=\"c-no\">725</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._knowledge_bases,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"726\"><span class=\"c-no\">726</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._cached_inputs,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"727\"><span class=\"c-no\">727</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    top_k=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.top_k,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"728\"><span class=\"c-no\">728</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    score_threshold=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.score_threshold,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"729\"><span class=\"c-no\">729</span><span class=\"c-src\">                )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"730\"><span class=\"c-no\">730</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> Exception:  <span class=\"c-com\"># pylint: disable=broad-except</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"731\"><span class=\"c-no\">731</span><span class=\"c-src\">                logger.exception(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"732\"><span class=\"c-no\">732</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Knowledge-base search failed; proceeding without &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"733\"><span class=\"c-no\">733</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;matched context.&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"734\"><span class=\"c-no\">734</span><span class=\"c-src\">                )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"735\"><span class=\"c-no\">735</span><span class=\"c-src\">                results = []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"736\"><span class=\"c-no\">736</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"737\"><span class=\"c-no\">737</span><span class=\"c-src\">            blocks = _format_results(results)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"738\"><span class=\"c-no\">738</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> blocks:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"739\"><span class=\"c-no\">739</span><span class=\"c-src\">                hint = HintBlock(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"740\"><span class=\"c-no\">740</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    hint=_wrap_hint(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.hint_template, blocks),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"741\"><span class=\"c-no\">741</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    source=_HINT_SOURCE,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"742\"><span class=\"c-no\">742</span><span class=\"c-src\">                )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"743\"><span class=\"c-no\">743</span><span class=\"c-src\">                agent.state.append_context(agent.name, [hint])</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"744\"><span class=\"c-no\">744</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.emit_hint_event:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"745\"><span class=\"c-no\">745</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span> HintBlockEvent(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"746\"><span class=\"c-no\">746</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        reply_id=agent.state.reply_id,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"747\"><span class=\"c-no\">747</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        block_id=hint.id,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"748\"><span class=\"c-no\">748</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        source=hint.source,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"749\"><span class=\"c-no\">749</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        hint=hint.hint,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"750\"><span class=\"c-no\">750</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"751\"><span class=\"c-no\">751</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"752\"><span class=\"c-no\">752</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"753\"><span class=\"c-no\">753</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> evt <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> next_handler(**input_kwargs):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"754\"><span class=\"c-no\">754</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span> evt</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"755\"><span class=\"c-no\">755</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">finally</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"756\"><span class=\"c-no\">756</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> hint <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._parameters.persist_hint:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"757\"><span class=\"c-no\">757</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-com\"># Remove the injected block from whichever message</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"758\"><span class=\"c-no\">758</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-com\"># ``append_context`` placed it on.  Reverse-scan</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"759\"><span class=\"c-no\">759</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-com\"># because that carrier is always the latest message</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"760\"><span class=\"c-no\">760</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-com\"># with our ``reply_id``.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"761\"><span class=\"c-no\">761</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> msg <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> reversed(agent.state.context):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"762\"><span class=\"c-no\">762</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> msg.id != agent.state.reply_id:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"763\"><span class=\"c-no\">763</span><span class=\"c-src\">                        <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"764\"><span class=\"c-no\">764</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    msg.content = [b <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> b <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> msg.content <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> b.id != hint.id]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"765\"><span class=\"c-no\">765</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">break</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"766\"><span class=\"c-no\">766</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>", "lines": 766, "explanation": "RAGMiddleware 两种模式：static（首轮自动检索，HintBlock 一次性注入，模型被动看）/agentic（暴露 search_knowledge 工具模型主动搜，默认推荐）。简单问答用 static，复杂多步用 agentic。", "knowledge_points": [{"title": "RAG", "body": "static（RAGMiddleware 自动检索 HintBlock 一次注入） / agentic（暴露 search_knowledge 工具主动搜）；KnowledgeBase 绑 embedding+vector_store；parser→chunker→embed 入库。"}], "related_docs": ["W07-中间件记忆与上下文治理", "W08-RAG与多Agent-Team与服务化", "07-记忆上下文与RAG", "agentscope-改造清单"]};
